Civic Ledger\par
\par
This installer copies the Civic Ledger Start/Stop app and the local Docker stack into your user profile.\par
\par
It does not download AI models by itself. After install, open Civic Ledger from the Start menu. You can pick a model already on this PC, or confirm before downloading the default model (qwen3:8b, about 5 GB).\par
\par
Docker Desktop must be installed and running. Civic Ledger only uses public political records. It does not collect private personal data.\par
\par
Manufacturer: Orffyrus\par
